$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=smshpi  LOC_AFTER=?

* The bad primes are at most half of all primes up to X: 1 + log M <_ 2 E log X, Chebyshev X / ( 3 log X ) <_ ppi X, and 96 C e^3 E <_ 1 / 2 (Lean: hlogM, hbadR2, hxL, hbadPi of smooth_shifted_weak).

